          "title": "You'll want to know: घटणे",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "घटणे — ghaṭṇe — \"to decline; to decrease\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "थंडीत भाज्यांचे दर घटले. thaṇḍīt bhājyāñce dar ghaṭle. Vegetable prices fell in the cold season."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (he …): तो घटला, to ghaṭlā."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Intransitive: what decreases is the subject."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "घटणे (ghaṭṇe) is inherited: CDIAL lists Marathi ghaṭṇẽ, \"to decrease\", under ghaṭṭati, \"decreases, is wanting\" (CDIAL 4415)."
            }
          ]
        },
